        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><p>Daedalus 7.2.0 is a mainnet release that updates links to the new proposal portal from IdeaScale to Project Catalyst.</p>
<p>Simultaneously, we're upgrading to node <a href="https://github.com/IntersectMBO/cardano-node/releases/tag/10.2.1">v.10.2.1</a> and cardano-wallet v2025-03-31 to ensure efficiency and compatibility.</p>
<p>This version also fixes an error that occurred when changing the display currency in ‘Settings → Wallets’. Users can now change their display currency without interruption.</p>
<p>It is recommended that all Daedalus users upgrade to this version.</p>
<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/compare/7.1.0...7.2.0"><tt>7.1.0...7.2.0</tt></a></p></div>
</div>
