        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><p>Daedalus 7.1.0 is a <strong>security and maintenance update</strong> that ensures compatibility with the <strong>Plomin Hard Fork</strong> while improving performance and stability.</p>
<h3>Key Updates &amp; Fixes</h3>
<h4>Security &amp; Stability Improvements</h4>
<ul>
<li>Updated <strong>cardano-node to 10.1.4</strong> and <strong>cardano-wallet to v2025-01-09</strong> to mitigate a potential <strong>DoS attack</strong> following the <strong>Plomin Hard Fork (Protocol Version 10)</strong>.</li>
</ul>
<h4>Bug Fixes</h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>CIP-129 DRep ID Support</strong> – Ensures full compatibility with new on-chain governance features.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>macOS Compatibility Fix</strong> – Resolved dynamic library loading issue affecting older macOS versions (10.15.x).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>Please read the <a href="https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/43885605379865" rel="nofollow">release notes</a> for more information.</p>
<p>Download Daedalus for Mainnet at <a href="https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&amp;utm_medium=github&amp;utm_campaign=github" rel="nofollow">daedaluswallet.io</a>.</p>
<p>Download Daedalus for Preview and Pre-prod testnets at <a href="https://docs.cardano.org/cardano-testnets/tools/daedalus-testnet/?utm_source=github&amp;utm_medium=github&amp;utm_campaign=github" rel="nofollow">docs.cardano.org</a>.</p>
<h2>Installer integrity verification</h2>
<h3>PGP signatures</h3>
<p>Installers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: <code>53D0 FA8D A2B8 D1FF 4975 AECB F99D 6C70 C2B3 FB43</code>.<br>
<a href="https://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/53D0FA8DA2B8D1FF4975AECBF99D6C70C2B3FB43" rel="nofollow">https://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/53D0FA8DA2B8D1FF4975AECBF99D6C70C2B3FB43</a></p></div>
</div>
